      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Parc des Buttes‑Chaumont and Parc de la Villette host the Cité des Sciences, the Conservatoire de Paris, Cabaret Sauvage, and the Zénith and Philharmonie de Paris music venues.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
